flowchart LR
  Owner[Owner / Accountant] --> Web[Next.js Owner Portal]
  Cashier[Cashier] --> WPF[WPF Desktop POS]
  Staff[Technician / Floor Staff] --> Flutter[Flutter Staff App]
  Customer[Customer] --> PWA[Customer Portal / PWA]
  Web --> API[.NET SaaS API - Modular Monolith]
  WPF --> Local1[(Encrypted SQLite)]
  Flutter --> Local2[(Encrypted Local Store)]
  Local1 <--> Sync[Sync / Outbox]
  Local2 <--> Sync
  Sync <--> API
  Web --> API
  PWA --> API
  API --> PG[(PostgreSQL + RLS)]
  API --> Jobs[Background Jobs / Outbox]
  Jobs --> Providers[Payment / SMS / Email / Market Data]
  API --> Files[Private Object Storage]
